  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil for the pasta. Thinly slice the onion and capsicum. Cut the olives in half. Crush or finely chop the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3580992/photos/large/164156_1-4cde070c653a10956fac6263f463d463.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook pasta: Cook the pasta in the pan of boiling water for 10 mins or until al dente. Reserve 125ml (½ cup) cooking water, then drain the pasta.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3580996/photos/large/164156_2-be1fbea5f6e3e8c7ab3c63b0ddfe8d3e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soften veggies: Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the onion and capsicum, stirring, for 3-4 mins until softened. Add the garlic and half the tomato paste and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3580998/photos/large/164156_3-29cbdd073e14a61ed9a0b396a8b87cba.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer sauce: Add the tomatoes, reserved cooking water (see Kitchen 101) and 1 tsp sugar to the veggie mixture and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium and cook, stirring occasionally, for 7-8 mins until slightly thickened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3581002/photos/large/164156_4-5d6a6ea981f1f97e48d4f1674bddd46e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the spinach, olives and pasta to the sauce and stir to combine. Taste, then season with salt and pepper. Divide the pasta among bowls, scatter over the vegan cheddar and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3581005/photos/large/164156_5-0d8c63f9d9e979f46221dee0c67c504b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Adding the starchy pasta cooking water helps emulsify the sauce so that it binds and coats the pasta.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3581007/photos/large/164156_6-99dc59d62dae078849a9d962b75973d6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
